    "transcriptSegments": [
      {
        "endSeconds": 405.2,
        "segmentId": 112,
        "startSeconds": 398.0,
        "text": "So before I start, I will show you a demonstration, which"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 408.6,
        "segmentId": 113,
        "startSeconds": 405.2,
        "text": "I'm not sure if that will be successful."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 410.0,
        "segmentId": 114,
        "startSeconds": 408.6,
        "text": "It's very difficult, actually."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 412.2,
        "segmentId": 115,
        "startSeconds": 410.0,
        "text": "And of course, during the break, you"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 415.84000000000003,
        "segmentId": 116,
        "startSeconds": 412.2,
        "text": "are welcome to come over and pray with all those demos."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 422.71999999999997,
        "segmentId": 117,
        "startSeconds": 415.88,
        "text": "So here I have two sticks, and I am going to create a soap bubble"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 429.52,
        "segmentId": 118,
        "startSeconds": 422.71999999999997,
        "text": "from this soap water and see if I will make it or not."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 433.67999999999995,
        "segmentId": 119,
        "startSeconds": 429.52,
        "text": "So basically, I put this into the soap water,"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 438.84,
        "segmentId": 120,
        "startSeconds": 433.67999999999995,
        "text": "and I will try to open it and to see if I can create a bubble."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 440.32,
        "segmentId": 121,
        "startSeconds": 438.84,
        "text": "Yeah."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 445.52,
        "segmentId": 122,
        "startSeconds": 440.32,
        "text": "You can see that there's a colorful soap bubble created."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 448.47999999999996,
        "segmentId": 123,
        "startSeconds": 446.71999999999997,
        "text": "Oh, OK."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 450.52,
        "segmentId": 124,
        "startSeconds": 448.47999999999996,
        "text": "You can see that it's not always easy."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 456.96,
        "segmentId": 125,
        "startSeconds": 454.96,
        "text": "Oh, it's getting very messy now."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 459.91999999999996,
        "segmentId": 126,
        "startSeconds": 456.96,
        "text": "I'm trying to destroy the classroom,"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 464.52,
        "segmentId": 127,
        "startSeconds": 459.91999999999996,
        "text": "but it's OK because we are in IT."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 466.71999999999997,
        "segmentId": 128,
        "startSeconds": 464.52,
        "text": "You can see that it's really beautiful."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 468.52,
        "segmentId": 129,
        "startSeconds": 466.71999999999997,
        "text": "It's colorful."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 470.55999999999995,
        "segmentId": 130,
        "startSeconds": 468.52,
        "text": "It did for a while."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 473.15999999999997,
        "segmentId": 131,
        "startSeconds": 470.55999999999995,
        "text": "Then it breaks."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 476.08000000000004,
        "segmentId": 132,
        "startSeconds": 473.16,
        "text": "So during the break, you are welcome to do this."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 481.8,
        "segmentId": 133,
        "startSeconds": 476.08000000000004,
        "text": "And it's actually not trivial to create this size of bubble."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 485.68,
        "segmentId": 134,
        "startSeconds": 481.8,
        "text": "So the success rate is like 50%."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 492.8,
        "segmentId": 135,
        "startSeconds": 485.68,
        "text": "OK, so as you can see from this demonstration,"
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 496.72,
        "segmentId": 136,
        "startSeconds": 492.8,
        "text": "we see something really beautiful."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 501.28000000000003,
        "segmentId": 137,
        "startSeconds": 496.72,
        "text": "This bubble is colorful."
      },
      {
        "endSeconds": 506.2,
        "segmentId": 138,
        "startSeconds": 501.28,
        "text": "And I did actually shine this soap bubble"
      }
